{"page":340,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"334","words":[{"text":"334","x":192,"y":128,"width":76,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER04 • 네트워크 계층 : 데이터 평면","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER04","x":574,"y":133,"width":164,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":769,"y":139,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"네트워크","x":813,"y":133,"width":101,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":925,"y":131,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":":","x":990,"y":137,"width":6,"height":20},{"text":"데이터","x":1012,"y":131,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"평면","x":1101,"y":130,"width":50,"height":30}]},{"text":"P4. 다음에 나타낸 스위치를 고려하자. 모든 데이터그램은 동일하게 고정된 길이를","words":[{"text":"P4.","x":572,"y":263,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"다음에","x":635,"y":259,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"나타낸","x":747,"y":258,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"스위치를","x":861,"y":259,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"고려하자.","x":1009,"y":257,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":1170,"y":258,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"데이터그램은","x":1258,"y":256,"width":208,"height":39},{"text":"동일하게","x":1483,"y":255,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"고정된","x":1647,"y":254,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"길이를","x":1774,"y":254,"width":91,"height":41}]},{"text":"가지고 있다고 가정하자. 스위치는 슬롯, 동기화 방식으로 운영되고, 하나의 시","words":[{"text":"가지고","x":634,"y":319,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"있다고","x":748,"y":318,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"가정하자.","x":860,"y":318,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":1016,"y":318,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"슬롯,","x":1168,"y":317,"width":76,"height":37},{"text":"동기화","x":1263,"y":316,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"방식으로","x":1385,"y":316,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"운영되고,","x":1544,"y":316,"width":156,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":1720,"y":313,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"시","x":1837,"y":319,"width":25,"height":37}]},{"text":"간 슬롯에서 데이터그램은 입력 포트에서 출력 포트로 전송된다. 스위치 구조는","words":[{"text":"간","x":632,"y":379,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"슬롯에서","x":678,"y":377,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"데이터그램은","x":823,"y":377,"width":198,"height":39},{"text":"입력","x":1037,"y":377,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"포트에서","x":1116,"y":376,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":1268,"y":376,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"포트로","x":1352,"y":379,"width":106,"height":29},{"text":"전송된다.","x":1477,"y":376,"width":151,"height":38},{"text":"스위치","x":1647,"y":375,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"구조는","x":1770,"y":377,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"대부분 하나의 데이터그램이 시간 슬롯에서 주어진 출력 포트로 전송될 수 있는","words":[{"text":"대부분","x":631,"y":439,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":741,"y":437,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"데이터그램이","x":853,"y":437,"width":195,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1066,"y":437,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"슬롯에서","x":1146,"y":436,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"주어진","x":1299,"y":436,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":1419,"y":437,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"포트로","x":1506,"y":440,"width":110,"height":28},{"text":"전송될","x":1633,"y":436,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1754,"y":436,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1805,"y":437,"width":59,"height":40}]},{"text":"크로스바이다 그러나 다른 출력 포트는 단일 시간 슬롯에서 다른 입력 포트로부","words":[{"text":"크로스바이다","x":629,"y":498,"width":203,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":846,"y":497,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":959,"y":497,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":1037,"y":497,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"포트는","x":1117,"y":498,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"단일","x":1234,"y":497,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"시간","x":1317,"y":497,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"슬롯에서","x":1400,"y":497,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1560,"y":497,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"입력","x":1649,"y":497,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"포트로부","x":1732,"y":501,"width":131,"height":37}]},{"text":"터 데이터그램을 받을 수 있다. 원하는 입력 큐 스게줄링을 예약할 수 있다고 가","words":[{"text":"터","x":629,"y":559,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":674,"y":558,"width":195,"height":39},{"text":"받을","x":883,"y":558,"width":66,"height